["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">揚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>举起；抬高；赞扬；油炸</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.げる・-あ.げ・あ.がる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">揚げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">油炸；炸（食物）；燃放（烟火等）；升起（旗等）；放（风筝）；放飞；召唤；传唤（艺妓等）；靠岸；上岸；移上陆地；吸收；吸取（水等）；汲取</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">冒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>冒险；开头；敢于；冒名；亵渎</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おか.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冒険</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冒险；冒险活动；冒险；危险；风险；危殆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冒頭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开头；开篇；开始；初始</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">之</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>的（所属、修饰）；这个；往；去</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">の・これ・ゆく・この</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曽</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1