p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>潜入；隐藏；潜伏；降低(声音)；潜行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひそ.む・もぐ.る・かく.れる・くぐ.る・ひそ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">潜る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くぐる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">穿过；通过；从下面通过；潜水；潜入水中；躲避；绕过；逃脱；度过；克服；渡过难关</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">潜水</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">潜水；潜入；下潜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">潜入</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんにゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">渗透；潜入；卧底</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">梨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>梨；梨树</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">仁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>仁爱；仁慈；慈善；果仁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジン・ニ・ニン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">克</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>克服；善于；灵巧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=