\">はか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">墓</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">墓；墓地；坟墓</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">墓地</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">墓地；墓园</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">黙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>沉默；安静；停止说话；不作声；保持原样</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">モク・ボク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">だま.る・もだ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">黙る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沉默；保持沉默；不说话</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沈黙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちんもく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沉默；寂静；安静；沉默寡言；不作为</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">須</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>必须；务必；必然</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ス・シュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すべから.く・すべし・ひげ・まつ・もち.いる・もと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">偏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>偏颇；偏袒；倾斜；一侧；偏旁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かたよ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偏</span><